# 414-yz-origin-plane: added by the parity loop from a Fusion probe
# yz-origin-plane: Rectangle (4,6)-(24,16) in the YZ plane's sketch frame (Fusion: x=-Z, y=+Y, normal +X), extruded 7 along the normal: Z -24..-4, Y 6..16, X 0..7.
# hand-written: the sketch is placed by picking the plane/face (Fox's own sketch frame), sketch coords as in the recipe
{"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "yz"}
